  // DISPENSER_WEIGHING_RS232_final): change them when the blocks are merged into the
  // D-SCUD PLC. The blocks take HMI commands only while their own in.automode is FALSE,
  // not from the machine's MANUAL state.
  // PLC TODO: the dispenser block has no member for the valve SN its controller reports. Once it
